---
interface Props {
	class?: string;
	style?: string;
}
const { class: className, style } = Astro.props;
---

<div class:list={["card-base p-4 text-center border border-black/[0.05] dark:border-white/[0.06]", className]} style={style}>
	<a
		href="https://link.coupang.com/a/igjU1bON2G"
		target="_blank"
		rel="noopener noreferrer"
		class="group block no-underline"
	>
		<div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg mb-3 bg-black/[0.02] dark:bg-white/[0.04] p-1.5 border border-black/[0.05] dark:border-white/[0.06]">
			<img
				src="/assets/img/partners/terarosa.jpg"
				alt="테라로사 원두"
				class="w-full h-auto rounded-md object-cover block"
				loading="lazy"
			/>
		</div>
		<div class="font-semibold text-sm text-black/85 dark:text-white/90 mb-2.5 break-keep">
			테라로사 원두
		</div>
		<span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg btn-regular text-xs font-semibold px-3.5 py-2 w-full">
			쿠팡에서 보기
		</span>
	</a>
	<p class="text-xs font-medium text-black/75 dark:text-white/75 mt-3 pt-2.5 border-t border-black/[0.07] dark:border-white/[0.09] leading-relaxed break-keep">
		이 포스팅은 쿠팡 파트너스 활동의 일환으로, 이에 따른 일정액의 수수료를 제공받습니다.
	</p>
</div>
